      "aud": "c-0-ar",
      "tr": "Fa"
    },
    {
      "en": "A small circle (like a head) with a dot on top and a tail curving to the right. Fa looks like a FLOWER with a dot the dot is the flower's center!",
      "title": "How to write Fa"
    },
    {
      "en": "With a fatha, Fa says “fa”.",
      "title": "Fa with fatha",
      "ar": "فَ",
      "aud": "c-2-ar"
    },
    {
      "en": "With a kasra, Fa says “fe”.",
      "title": "Fa with kasra",
      "ar": "فِ",
      "aud": "c-3-ar"
    },
    {
      "en": "With a damma, Fa says “fo”.",
